{"steam_appid":1766740,"steam_name":"Choo-Choo Charles","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1766740/515126/fb82c4421e8c4721d582fa517bef4002f0b0ece8/1750733744/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1670596621","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256916988/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1670596621","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/ss_4640a276227c2eedb6581834fd90c238fbe82d75.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776483802","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/ss_656dfa0b4bcf63fa5e4b58b9c08a246fcca7fa4a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776483802","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/ss_a14759e19ccb4546a50089863e9475839edc256a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776483802","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/ss_031d0dd9d47a77838a3476a4dd589b8494932921.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776483802","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/ss_b54cf2f33b0b8ce6c794e9d5bfa4b83251b6829a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776483802"],"about_the_game":"<strong><i>Charles is a bloodthirsty train, and you need to destroy him.</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate a massive play area in your trusty old engine.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/92b6e944694b29f4d49f017b18c9a43d.poster.avif?t=1776483802\" width=630 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/92b6e944694b29f4d49f017b18c9a43d.webm?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/92b6e944694b29f4d49f017b18c9a43d.mp4?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>These winding tracks are treacherous, so you'll need to plan each mission carefully. Be wary when traveling on foot, or switching the track's direction; Charles might be waiting for you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your train to fit your needs.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/7739bcef9e5bf543b837fc020b7d1be4.poster.avif?t=1776483802\" width=630 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/7739bcef9e5bf543b837fc020b7d1be4.webm?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/7739bcef9e5bf543b837fc020b7d1be4.mp4?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Go looting or complete missions to find &quot;Scraps&quot;, which can be used to turn your train into a death machine on wheels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get help from the townspeople.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/602aa96dc94fb241f3397ab38648f5d7.poster.avif?t=1776483802\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/602aa96dc94fb241f3397ab38648f5d7.webm?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/602aa96dc94fb241f3397ab38648f5d7.mp4?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Help out the settlers in return for high powered weapons, and other items vital to Charles' destruction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Charles <i>to the death</i>.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/106ec32c1ae86885947e59be076d75fe.poster.avif?t=1776483802\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/106ec32c1ae86885947e59be076d75fe.webm?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766740/extras/106ec32c1ae86885947e59be076d75fe.mp4?t=1776483802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Complete the main questline, and summon Charles to a mortal duel. If you’ve gained enough strength, firepower, and skill, Charles may finally meet his match.","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad-core Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 470 GTX or AMD Radeon 6870 HD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game includes graphics settings to aid lower end devices.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Two Star Games"],"publishers":["Two Star Games"],"release_date":"9 Dec, 2022"}